    "title": "Detectable viral load requires enhanced adherence plan",
    "message": "Guidelines require that patients on DTG-based ART with VL >50 copies/mL receive enhanced adherence support, have potential side-effects addressed, and repeat VL in 2-3 months. The clinician's plan addresses carbamazepine toxicity but does not document enhanced adherence counselling or a repeat viral load plan. The drug interaction with carbamazepine may itself be the side-effect affecting adherence.",
    "issue_type": "plan_add",
